same way `cnf_size` counts, checked against it on the atlas.\"\"\"\n    m2 = sum(degrees)                     # 2m\n    T = n - 1\n    # y: n(n−1); x: n(n−1); o, b: n(n−1) each; counter: per level Σ_i min(i+1, k+1)\n    counter_vars = sum(min(i + 1, k + 1) for i in range(n))\n    variables = 4 * n * T + T * counter_vars\n    # clauses per level\n    clauses = 0\n    inc = 0\n    for t in range(1, n):\n        if t == 1:\n            clauses += 2 * n; inc += 4 * n            # x ↔ y\n        else:\n====TOOLS\npysat 1.9.dev15 nx 3.3\n====MATHLIB\n907:abbrev IsIndepSet (s : Set α) : Prop :=\n910:theorem isIndepSet_iff : G.IsIndepSet s ↔ s.Pairwise (fun v w ↦ ¬G.Adj v w) :=\n913:theorem isIndepSet_iff_isAntichain_adj : G.IsIndepSet s ↔ IsAntichain G.Adj s :=\n917:@[simp] theorem isClique_compl : Gᶜ.IsClique s ↔ G.IsIndepSet s := by\n922:@[simp] theorem isIndepSet_compl : Gᶜ.IsIndepSet s ↔ G.IsClique s := by\nlean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Clique.lean:907:abbrev IsIndepSet (s : Set α) : Prop :=\nlean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Star.lean:79:def Coloring.starGraphBool [DecidableEq V] : (starGraph r).Coloring Bool where\nlean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Sum.lean:204:def Coloring.sum (cG : G.Coloring γ) (cH : H.Coloring γ) : (G ⊕g H).Coloring γ where\nlean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Sum.lean:209:def Coloring.sumLeft (c : (G ⊕g H).Coloring γ) : G.Coloring γ := c.comp Embedding.sumInl.toHom\nlean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Sum.lean:212:def Coloring.sumRight (c : (G ⊕g H).Coloring γ) : H.Coloring γ := c.comp Embedding.sumInr.toHom\nlean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Sum.lean:227:def Coloring.sumEquiv : (G ⊕g H).Coloring γ ≃ G.Coloring γ × H.Coloring γ where\nlean/.lake/packages/mathlib/Mathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/Sum.lean:234:def Coloring.sumFin {n m : ℕ} (cG : G.Coloring (Fin n)) (cH : H.Coloring 