ted; the item is about problems *parameterised by*\n  pathwidth.\n\nRegenerate:\n\n    cd ~/dev/MOSP\n    D=reports/scratch/subexp_pathwidth/06_crossover\n    nice -n 19 python3 -m learning.subexp_crossover --nmax 7 --out $D > $D/check_atlas7.log\n    python3 -m learning.subexp_crossover --table\n    python3 -m pytest tests/test_subexp_crossover.py -q\n    cd lean && lake build && lake env lean ../$D/axiom_check.lean | tee ../$D/axiom_check.log\n===AXIOM\n/-\nAxiom audit of loop0014 item 06 (`lean/MOSPFormalization/SubexpPathwidth/Crossover.lean`):\nevery declaration, printed with the axioms it depends on. Expected:\n`[propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]` or fewer on every line.\n\n    cd lean && lake env lean ../reports/scratch/subexp_pathwidth/06_crossover/axiom_check.lean\n-/\nimport MOSPFormalization\n\nopen MOSPFormalization.SubexpPathwidth\n\n#print axioms edgeClause\n#print axioms indepCNF\n#print axioms indepCount\n#print axioms edgeClause_card_le\n#print axioms indepCNF_width\n#print axioms edgeClause_eval\n#print axioms indepCNF_eval_iff\n#print axioms count_indepCNF\n#print axioms indepCount_subexp\n#print axioms crossoverThreshold\n#print axioms rpow_le_of_crossover\n#print axioms crossoverThreshold_eventually_lt\n#print axioms counting_beats_dp_eventually\n'MOSPFormalization.SubexpPathwidth.edgeClause' depends on axioms: [propext, Quot.sound]\n'MOSPFormalization.SubexpPathwidth.indepCNF' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'MOSPFormalization.SubexpPathwidth.indepCount' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'MOSPFormalization.SubexpPathwidth.edgeClause_card_le' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'MOSPFormalization.SubexpPathwidth.indepCNF_width' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'MOSPFormalization.SubexpPathwidth.edgeClause_eval' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]\n'MOSPFormalization.SubexpPathwidth.indepCNF_eval_iff' depends on axi